{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model with multiprofile settings and avgpool aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5907 and F1 of 0.5727. The results suggest multiprofile may improve performance compared to singleprofile configurations, though the impact of profile settings remains uncertain without direct comparison to other architectural variations. The role of RNA encoder choice (pca_n2000 vs scvi_n200) and aggregation methods is also unclear."
}

